=============================================================
              TESTRUN FOR NEMO_3D
=============================================================

1. Files:
---------
NEMO_3D/build/make.inc
NEMO_3D/build/Makefile
NEMO_3D/nemo3d/example/TestRun/
NEMO_3D/nemo3d/example/TestRun/README
NEMO_3D/nemo3d/example/TestRun/Makefile
NEMO_3D/nemo3d/example/TestRun/Si_Bulk.old_nd_Ek
NEMO_3D/nemo3d/example/TestRun/CdSe_Nanocrystal.old_nd_Ek
NEMO_3D/nemo3d/example/TestRun/InGaAs_QD.old_nd_Ek
NEMO_3D/nemo3d/example/TestRun/InGaAs_CoupledQD.old_nd_Ek
NEMO_3D/nemo3d/example/TestRun/inputs/
NEMO_3D/nemo3d/example/TestRun/inputs/Si_Bulk.xml
NEMO_3D/nemo3d/example/TestRun/inputs/CdSe_Nanocrystal.xml
NEMO_3D/nemo3d/example/TestRun/inputs/InGaAs_QD.xml
NEMO_3D/nemo3d/example/TestRun/inputs/InGaAs_CoupledQD.xml

2. Howto:
---------
2.1. Change to the NEMO_3D/build/ directory, 
	$cd ~/My_path_to_NEMO_3D/NEMO_3D/build/

2.2. Make the test, just type
	$make test

3. Output:
----------
The tests can take about 15mins to be finished. 

3.1. OK: If everything is OK, then the eigenvaules in 
     NEMO_3D/nemo3d/example/TestRun/inputs/*.nd_Ek_ascii
     will be the same as the old ones, 
     NEMO_3D/nemo3d/example/TestRun/*.old_nd_Ek.
     One gets in the output: 
     ===== NEMO_3D TEST MADE: CONGRATULLATIONS! test OK ==== 

3.2. NOT OK: If the executable is producing a different output, 
     you will see in the output a warning message: 
     ===== NEMO_3D TEST MADE:  WARNING: Your new executable is 
     producing DIFFERENT OUTPUT than before!!! ===== 	 
     -Check differences between old and new eigenvalues in
      NEMO_3D/nemo3d/example/TestRun/*.difs	
     -Check the output from NEMO_3D: that is dumped in *.out

4. Clean:
---------
To repeat the test, just type from the NEMO_3D/build/ directory:
	$make clean_test
to run again all the input files, just type from the NEMO_3D/build/ 
directory:
	$make cleanall_test

